title: Dashboard › Header › Check all now and the demo clock
route: /dashboard
intro: The one button in the page header, which Settings can switch off by pausing Navigator, and what the Demo menu's clock does to the numbers on this page. Time in the demo only moves when someone moves it.
dir: TD
also: Real world: Navigator checks every open request at least daily, and a request past the payer's time gets a call-the-payer task. Demo only: the button and the clock are simulated.
---
start s0 "Look at the header\n'Check all now' sits top right of the headline card"
decision dp "Is Navigator paused in Settings?"
screen sp "'Check all now' is disabled\nUnder it a link: 'Navigator is paused in Settings'"
click cs "Click 'Navigator is paused in Settings'"
goto gs "Continues in: Settings › Pause › What the rest of the app shows"
endx xs "Nothing runs\nResume Navigator in Settings and the button works again"
click s1 "Click 'Check all now'"
process p1 "Button shows a spinner and is disabled for 1.2 seconds"
agent a1 "Navigator looks at every open request\nReceived and Under review, whatever the filters say"
store w1 "Each open request gets a history line\n'Navigator checked: received' or 'Navigator checked: under review'"
toast t1 "'Navigator checked 18 open requests'\n'No new answers yet. It checks again in 30 minutes.'"
end e1 "Button is ready again\nNo request changes stage"

start s2 "Demo menu › Click 'Fast-forward 1 hour' or 'Fast-forward 1 day'"
store c1 "Demo clock moves forward\nNothing else moves time"
toast t2 "'Clock moved forward 1 hour' or '1 day'\n'Times in stage and deadlines updated.'"
process p2 "Dashboard recomputes from the new time"

group gClock "What the clock changes on the Dashboard"
  process r1 "Table: time in stage grows\nOver 1.5 × typical shows 'late'; over 2 × shows 'very late'"
  process r2 "Table: open denials count down\n'36 h left', '3 days left', then 'window closed'"
  process r3 "Table order: very late and late rows move up"
  process r4 "Stage strip: 'Appeal or call' counts 'deadlines this week' from the new time"
  process r5 "Calendar: today moves, so the last pickable day and the shortcuts end on the new day"
endgroup
process p3 "Not changed: the default range Sep 21 – Oct 20, 2026, the stage counts and the payers figures"
goto g1 "Continues in: Global shell › Demo menu"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Requests table › Read a row: bars, clock and what happens next"
goto g3 "Continues in: Dashboard › Filters › Date range shortcuts, keys and the address"

s0 --> dp
dp -->|No| s1 --> p1 --> a1 --> w1 --> t1 --> e1
dp -->|Yes| sp --> cs --> gs
sp -.-> xs
s2 --> c1 --> t2 --> p2
p2 --> r1 & r2 & r3 & r4 & r5
r1 --> g2
r2 --> g2
r5 --> g3
p2 -.-> p3
s2 -.-> g1
